    "es": "También me pone inocentes nadas en mis ficheros .conf. Me llevará siglos hacer que las X me vuelvan a funcionar.",
    "en": "And she put sweet nothings in all my .conf files. It'll take me forever to get X working again.",
    "noteEn": "The title text extends the joke to configuration files and the X Window System, whose settings could also be broken by affectionate-looking edits."
  },
